":"`WorldReaction` 格子"},"191":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-9","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"パズル盤面（連鎖 cascade = 格子の広がり）"},"192":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-10","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"`ReactionRule`"},"193":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-11","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"特殊ブロック組み合わせ表: Trigger=特殊ブロック, Target=周囲ブロック種類, Effect=消去/変換"},"194":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-12","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"`DataService<RuleData>`"},"195":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-13","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"表を差し替えるだけで新特殊ブロック追加 = **コード変更なしのライブ運用**"},"196":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-14","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"`TensionModel`"},"197":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-15","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"プレイヤーの圧力（残り手数・目標進捗）で難易度のゴムひも調整"},"198":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-16","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"`DirectorBrain` の局面"},"199":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-17","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"序盤は余裕(BuildUp) → 終盤の山場(Peak) → クリア後の鎮静(Relax)"},"200":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-18","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"`SeedAction`"},"201":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-19","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#部品の対応","content":"`DropGoodPiece`（詰まったら良いブロック） · `AddBlocker`（簡単すぎたら妨害）"},"202":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-20","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#ルール表の例","content":"要素だけ変えればマッチ3の組み合わせ表になります。"},"203":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-21","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#ルール表の例","content":"`RuleValidator` がビルド前に「存在しないブロック種類・矛盾するルール」を検出するので、運用中に表を\n増やしても安全です。"},"204":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-22","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#ディレクターでゴムひも調整","content":"マッチ3の核心は「ギリギリでクリアさせる」感覚です。ディレクターが緊張度（残り手数の圧力）を見て\n条件を撒きます — 詰まったら良いブロックをそっと落とし（`DropGoodPiece`）、簡単すぎたら妨害物を足す。\nただし **前兆**（次に落ちるブロックのプレビュー）を見せ、「運」ではなく「読んで判断」と感じさせます。"},"205":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-23","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**表＝ライブコンテンツ。** 新イベントブロックを `RuleData` の1行で追加し、アプリ更新なしでリモートデータ配信。"},"206":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-24","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**ゴムひもは控えめに。** 露骨すぎると気づかれます。`RiseSpeed`/`FallSpeed` でゆっくり。"},"207":{"id":"/ja/examples/match-3-25","page_id":"/ja/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/match-3#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**連鎖は爽快に、上限ははっきり。** 同時連鎖の上限で低スペック端末のカクつきを防ぎます。"},"208":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","type":"page","content":"サバイバー系","breadcrumbs":["Docs","活用事例"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like"},"209":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-0","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","content":"Vampire Survivors / Survivor.io / Archero — AI ディレクターでウェーブの強弱を自動調整。"},"210":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-1","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"部品の対応"},"211":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-2","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#流れ","content":"流れ"},"212":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-3","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"モバイルのチェックポイント"},"213":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-4","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","content":"> **なぜ合うか:** このジャンルは実質 Left 4 Dead の「AI ディレクター」そのものです。Tempo の\n> 緊張度 → ディレクター → ワールドのひと回りが、まさに「畳みかけ ↔ 一息」のリズムになります。"},"214":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-5","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"Tempo"},"215":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-6","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"サバイバー系では"},"216":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-7","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`TensionModel.Current`"},"217":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-8","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"敵スポーン密度・難易度ゲージ"},"218":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-9","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`SampleThreat`"},"219":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-10","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"画面内の敵数 + ボス接近度"},"220":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-11","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`SampleAround`"},"221":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-12","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"床の地形効果（毒・炎・電場）の危険度"},"222":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-13","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`DirectorBrain` の局面"},"223":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-14","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"小康(BuildUp) → ラッシュ/エリート(Peak) → 一息(Relax)"},"224":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-15","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`SeedAction`"},"225":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-16","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`SpawnSwarm` · `SpawnElite` · `OpenHazardZone` · `DropHealing`"},"226":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-17","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"`WorldReaction`"},"227":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-18","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"火の海・毒雲が格子で広がる（標準機能のまま）"},"228":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-19","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"安全装置の上限"},"229":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-20","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#部品の対応","content":"同時の敵/地形効果の上限 = **モバイルの発熱・電池・フレーム防御**"},"230":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-21","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#流れ","content":"蓄積では敵を減らし回復/アイテムを流して一息つかせます。緊張度が低く落ち着いたら、まもなくラッシュ。\n爆発ではエリートウェーブ＋床の地形効果を同時に撒いて画面を締めます。ただし **前兆**（ウェーブ警告リング、\n地面が赤く灯る）を必ず先に見せ、「理不尽な死」にならないようにします。"},"231":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-22","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#流れ","content":"`SpawnSwarm`/`SpawnElite` は敵を直接出すのではなく **スポーン条件**（スポーンゲートを開く）を撒き、\n実際のプーリング/配置はゲームのスポーンシステムが受けます。ディレクターは「いつ・どれだけ」だけを決めます。"},"232":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-23","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**上限がそのまま性能予算。** `MaxActiveEvents` と同時敵数の上限で低スペック端末のフレームを守る。"},"233":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-24","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**セッションが短い。** 局面サイクルを1〜2分にして、1プレイ内で蓄積→爆発→休息が何度も回るように。"},"234":{"id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like-25","page_id":"/ja/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/survivor-like#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**前兆は大きく。** 小さな画面では警告が埋もれるので、リングや画面端の赤化ではっきりと。"},"235":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","type":"page","content":"タワーディフェンス","breadcrumbs":["Docs","活用事例"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense"},"236":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-0","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","content":"Random Dice / ディフェンス系 — ウェーブの強弱を自動調整 + 状態異常の連鎖。"},"237":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-1","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"部品の対応"},"238":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-2","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#状態連鎖こそ要素反応","content":"状態連鎖こそ要素反応"},"239":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-3","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"モバイルのチェックポイント"},"240":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-4","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","content":"> **なぜ合うか:** 2つが同時にハマります — ディレクターのウェーブ・ペーシング(Left 4 Dead)と、\n> 凍結・感電が敵の群れへ広がる状態異常の連鎖(BotW の電気チェーンそのまま)。"},"241":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-5","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"Tempo"},"242":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-6","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"タワーディフェンスでは"},"243":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-7","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"`TensionModel`"},"244":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-8","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"防衛線の圧力（漏れた敵数、コア HP）"},"245":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-9","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"`DirectorBrain` の局面"},"246":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-10","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"偵察(BuildUp) → ラッシュ/特殊敵(Peak) → 立て直し(Relax)"},"247":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-11","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"`SeedAction`"},"248":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-12","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"`SeedColdSnap`（凍結場）· `ChargeStorm`（感電チェーン）· `SpawnRusher`"},"249":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-13","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"`WorldReaction`"},"250":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-14","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"状態伝播：凍結/感電が罹患した敵から隣の敵へ広がる（要素反応のまま）"},"251":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-15","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"安全装置の上限"},"252":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-16","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#部品の対応","content":"同時の敵/弾の上限 = モバイルのフレーム防御"},"253":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-17","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#状態連鎖こそ要素反応","content":"BotW の「電気が金属を伝って広がる」ルールが、ディフェンスの「感電が濡れた/金属の敵の群れへチェーン」に\nそのまま移ります。`ReactionRule` 表を敵の状態異常として読むだけです。"},"254":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-18","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#状態連鎖こそ要素反応","content":"防衛線が楽すぎれば（緊張度が低い）ディレクターがラッシュ/特殊敵を撒いて締め、手に負えなければ（高い）\n息継ぎを与えます。プレイヤーが敷いた凍結場へ感電を誘導する「要素コンボ」も、同じ表から自然に生まれます。"},"255":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-19","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**コンボが手応え。** 凍結 → 感電のような連鎖をルール表に置けば、新コンボをデータでライブ追加。"},"256":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-20","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**ウェーブ・ペーシング＝難易度曲線。** ステージを手で組まなくてもディレクターが圧力を調整。"},"257":{"id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense-21","page_id":"/ja/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/examples/tower-defense#モバイルのチェックポイント","content":"**上限＝性能。** 同時の敵/弾の上限で、終盤の物量戦でもフレームを安定維持。"},"258":{"id":"/ja/usage/director","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","type":"page","content":"ディレクター","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/director"},"259":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director","content":"緊張度ひとつを見て局面を決め、予算の範囲で条件だけを撒く側。"},"260":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"条件撒き1種 — `SeedAction`"},"261":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-2","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/director#ディレクターの頭脳--directorbrain","content":"ディレクターの頭脳 — `DirectorBrain`"},"262":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-3","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/director#局面と予算","content":"局面と予算"},"263":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-4","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/director#ちらつき防止--phasefsm","content":"ちらつき防止 — `PhaseFsm`"},"264":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-5","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director","content":"ディレクターは敵を直接出しません。緊張度の数値ひとつを見て局面（蓄積→爆発→休息）を決め、\n使える量（予算）の範囲でアクションを選び、ワールドに **条件だけ** を撒きます。"},"265":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-6","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"`Intent` が局面と結びつきます — **Prepare**（蓄積）・**Trigger**（爆発）・**Calm**（休息）。\n各アクションは `CanSeed` で「今撒いてよいか」を先に確認し、ワールドの入口（`ApplyElement`/`SetWind`）だけを呼びます。"},"266":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-7","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"標準4種："},"267":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-8","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"アクション"},"268":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-9","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"Intent"},"269":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-10","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"役割"},"270":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-11","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"`DryUpwind`"},"271":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-12","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"Prepare"},"272":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-13","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"風を立てて乾かし、よく燃える条件を整える（まだ着火しない）"},"273":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-14","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"`IgniteUpwind`"},"274":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"Trigger"},"275":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"風上の乾いた草に火種を投げる → 風に乗ってプレイヤーへ"},"276":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-17","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"`ChargeStorm`"},"277":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-18","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"Trigger"},"278":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-19","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"金属／水たまりの上に雷雲を出して感電"},"279":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-20","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"`SummonRain`"},"280":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-21","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"Calm"},"281":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-22","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#条件撒き1種--seedaction","content":"雨で消火・湿らせて一息つかせる"},"282":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-23","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#ディレクターの頭脳--directorbrain","content":"オーバーライドなしで使うなら `DefaultDirectorBrain` を使います。"},"283":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-24","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#局面と予算","content":"局面ごとにディレクターの使える量（予算）を変えます。`PhaseData` に記述します。"},"284":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-25","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#局面と予算","content":"**蓄積(BuildUp)** — よく燃える条件だけを少しずつ（乾いた草・電気・燃料）。予算は少なく、危険でないものだけ。"},"285":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-26","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#局面と予算","content":"**爆発(Peak)** — 蓄積に火種を投げて一気に。予算を多く。"},"286":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-27","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#局面と予算","content":"**休息(Relax)** — 雨で消して一息つき、予算を回復。消す系のみ。"},"287":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-28","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#局面と予算","content":"既定の `PickActions` は局面に合う `Intent` のアクションを、予算内で、`CanSeed` を通るものだけ選びます。\n細かな方針が要るならオーバーライドします。"},"288":{"id":"/ja/usage/director-29","page_id":"/ja/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/director#ちらつき防止--phasefsm","content":"しきい値が1つだと境界で局面が行き来してちらつきます。そこで **上げる基準と下げる基準を変え**\n（ヒステリシス）、最低限の休息時間を保証します。"},"289":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","type":"page","content":"安全装置","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/safeguards"},"290":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards","content":"連鎖が大きくなりすぎないよう抑え、ディレクターが撒いた条件は必ず前兆で見せる。"},"291":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#1-上限","content":"1\\. 上限"},"292":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-2","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#2-休息局面では消火を優先","content":"2\\. 休息局面では消火を優先"},"293":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-3","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#3-足元で起きても少し手加減","content":"3\\. 足元で起きても少し手加減"},"294":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-4","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"4\\. 前もって見せる（前兆）"},"295":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-5","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#デバッグで確認する","content":"デバッグで確認する"},"296":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-6","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards","content":"ワールドはディレクターも想定しない大連鎖を生むことがあります。そこでいくつかの装置を置きます。"},"297":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-7","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#1-上限","content":"同時に起きる事象の数／総量に上限を設けます。超えたら新しい着火（Trigger）を一時的に止めます。"},"298":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-8","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#1-上限","content":"`WorldReaction.BurningCells` で現在燃えているマス数も見られ、より厳しい上限を掛けられます。"},"299":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-9","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#2-休息局面では消火を優先","content":"休息（Relax）局面では `Intent == Calm` のアクション（雨・消火）だけを選びます。既定方針が既にそう動きます。"},"300":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-10","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#3-足元で起きても少し手加減","content":"ディレクターが撒いた条件が足元で起きて即死しないよう、プレイヤー付近では威力を下げる／一拍遅らせる\nなどで少し手加減します。（ダメージ処理側で距離補正を入れる箇所）"},"301":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-11","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"最も重要です。ディレクターが撒いた条件は **必ず前兆で見せます** — 雷雲が迫り、風が乾いていく。\n見せないとプレイヤーは「なぜ突然死んだ？」となります。"},"302":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-12","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"`DryUpwind` → 風が強まり乾く演出（草の揺れ・音）。"},"303":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-13","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"`ChargeStorm` → まず雷雲が迫る演出。"},"304":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-14","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"`IgniteUpwind` → 遠くの風上に小さな火種／煙が先に見えるように。"},"305":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"`DirectorBrain.CurrentPhase` と `WorldReaction.ActiveEvents` を読んで前兆演出を出してください。"},"306":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#4-前もって見せる前兆","content":"> **なぜ重要か:** BotW は「ちょっとした目くらまし」を使いつつ、見せるべきものははっきり見せました。\n> 逆にウルティマオンラインの自律生態系は、プレイヤーが気づけず失敗しました。\n> &#x2A;*見せるべきものははっきり見せること。**"},"307":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-17","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#デバッグで確認する","content":"エディタの **Tools → Tempo → Debug Window** で緊張度グラフ・局面・事象数・燃えているマスを\nリアルタイムに見られます。ゲームコードから接続します。"},"308":{"id":"/ja/usage/safeguards-18","page_id":"/ja/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/safeguards#デバッグで確認する","content":"ビルド前に **Tools → Tempo → Validate Rules**（または自動ビルド検査）で、ルール表の存在しない素材・\n矛盾するルールを検出します。"},"309":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","type":"page","content":"緊張度","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/tension"},"310":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension","content":"プレイヤーの脅威と周囲の状況を 0〜1 の数値ひとつに合成するモデル。"},"311":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/tension#3つの段階","content":"3つの段階"},"312":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-2","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/tension#外から見える部分","content":"外から見える部分"},"313":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-3","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/tension#被弾は即時脅威は徐々に","content":"被弾は即時、脅威は徐々に"},"314":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-4","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/tension#テスト用に信号を差し替える","content":"テスト用に信号を差し替える"},"315":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-5","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"調整値 — `TensionConfig`"},"316":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-6","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension","content":"ディレクターが見るのは数値ひとつ、緊張度（0〜1）だけです。`TensionModel` が3段階でこの数値を作ります：\n&#x2A;*2つの信号を 0〜1 に揃える → 合成する → なめらかにする。**"},"317":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-7","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#3つの段階","content":"**0〜1に揃える** — プレイヤーの脅威と周囲の事象をそれぞれ 0〜1 の範囲に。"},"318":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-8","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#3つの段階","content":"**合成する** — どちらか一方でも高ければ全体が上がり、両方高ければほぼ最大（1は超えない）。\n式は `1-(1-a)(1-b)`。"},"319":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-9","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#3つの段階","content":"**なめらかにする** — 上がるときは速く、下がるときはゆっくり。危険は即、安心は徐々に。"},"320":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-10","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#3つの段階","content":"> **合成の2通り**\n>\n> * 既定: `1-(1-a)(1-b)`。\n> * よりくっきり: 2つの大きい方 `Mathf.Max(a, b)`。\n>\n> **要は「上がるときは速く、下がるときはゆっくり」。** これで蓄積→爆発→休息の流れが自然になります。"},"321":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-11","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#被弾は即時脅威は徐々に","content":"`Tick` の中では、近い脅威ほど大きく蓄積し、時間とともに徐々に下がります。"},"322":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-12","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#テスト用に信号を差し替える","content":"2つのサンプルメソッドは `virtual` なので、物理シーンなしでテストから信号を直接注入できます\n（インターフェースの代わりに差し替え）。"},"323":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-13","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#テスト用に信号を差し替える","content":"既定の `SampleThreat` は `Physics.OverlapSphere` で周囲の敵を数え、`SampleAround` は\n`world.ActiveEvents` から近くの大きい事象ほど大きく評価します。"},"324":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-14","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"強さ・半径・重み・速度・しきい値はすべてデータです。範囲はゲームで調整します。"},"325":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"値"},"326":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"意味"},"327":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-17","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"`DamageGain`"},"328":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-18","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"被弾時の即時上昇量"},"329":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-19","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"`ThreatGain` / `StressDecay`"},"330":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-20","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"脅威の蓄積 / ストレス減衰"},"331":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-21","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"`StressWeight` / `AroundWeight`"},"332":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-22","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"2信号を合成する際の重み"},"333":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-23","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"`RiseSpeed` / `FallSpeed`"},"334":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-24","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"上昇時 / 下降時の時定数"},"335":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-25","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"`ThreatRadius` / `AroundRadius`"},"336":{"id":"/ja/usage/tension-26","page_id":"/ja/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/tension#調整値--tensionconfig","content":"サンプリング半径"},"337":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","type":"page","content":"ワールドリアクション","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction"},"338":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","content":"火・水・電気がルール通りに変化し、格子上で広がる側。"},"339":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction