:"/ja/usage/world-reaction-11","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"反応はコードではなく表（データ）に置きます。「この要素が／この素材に触れ／しきい値を超えたら → こう変わる」。"},"350":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-12","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"対象素材は **配列 UI ではなく `;` 区切りの1欄** に書きます（取り決め）。読み込み時に一度だけ分割して\nキャッシュします。空にすると全素材が対象です。"},"351":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-13","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"BotW の3つの基本ルールを出発点にします。"},"352":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-14","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"要素が **素材** を変える — 火が乾いた草を燃やす。"},"353":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"要素が **別の要素** を変える — 水が火を消す。"},"354":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"状況に応じて要素が **力** を生む — 電気が金属で感電を起こす。"},"355":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-17","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#反応ルール--reactionrule","content":"ルール表は `DataService<RuleData>.GetDataCenter()` で取得します。"},"356":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-18","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#延焼と結果--worldreaction","content":"**広がり方:** 平らな格子（`SortedSet` ではなく平面配列・`Dictionary`）でルールを適用し、隣のマスへ\n燃え移らせます。風向き＋隣の燃えやすさに応じて毎フレーム広がります。"},"357":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-19","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#延焼と結果--worldreaction","content":"**`ActiveEvents`:** 1件が `ReactionEvent`（位置・大きさ・残り時間・種類）です。ディレクターと緊張度\nモデルがこの一覧を見ます。終わった件は毎フレーム片付け、近くの同種は1件にまとめます。"},"358":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-20","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#直接条件を撒く","content":"`ApplyElement` は触れたマスに即座にルール表を適用し（水が触れればその場で消火）、その後 `Tick` が延焼を\n続けます。"},"359":{"id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction-21","page_id":"/ja/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/world-reaction#直接条件を撒く","content":"> 性能: 格子計算は Jobs/Burst + `NativeArray` とも好相性です。既定実装は依存なしで動くよう、管理された\n> 平面配列を使います。"}},"count":359},"sorting":{"language":"english","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":164,"2":271,"3":48,"4":138,"5":257,"6":45,"7":66,"8":47,"9":123,"10":44,"11":46,"12":195,"13":238,"14":201,"15":339,"16":51,"17":87,"18":187,"19":54,"20":85,"21":317,"22":52,"23":42,"24":355,"25":115,"26":40,"27":357,"28":79,"29":39,"30":300,"31":82,"32":38,"33":233,"34":130,"35":37,"36":285,"37":74,"38":98,"39":88,"40":100,"41":75,"42":78,"43":239,"44":202,"45":340,"46":58,"47":91,"48":316,"49":131,"50":43,"51":281,"52":50,"53":136,"54":185,"55":94,"56":134,"57":186,"58":89,"59":135,"60":267,"61":63,"62":113,"63":305,"64":77,"65":76,"66":93,"67":240,"68":203,"69":341,"70":57,"71":80,"72":215,"73":95,"74":81,"75":228,"76":90,"77":36,"78":334,"79":132,"80":41,"81":326,"82":107,"83":97,"84":329,"85":105,"86":96,"87":268,"88":61,"89":121,"90":92,"91":49,"92":102,"93":103,"94":62,"95":270,"96":221,"97":152,"98":344,"99":288,"100":18,"101":12,"102":29,"103":32,"104":6,"105":15,"106":9,"107":16,"108":222,"109":189,"110":291,"111":188,"112":260,"113":333,"114":208,"115":199,"116":306,"117":181,"118":273,"119":182,"120":234,"121":320,"122":160,"123":227,"124":245,"125":170,"126":252,"127":211,"128":303,"129":213,"130":178,"131":225,"132":269,"133":307,"134":194,"135":156,"136":4,"137":11,"138":150,"139":308,"140":346,"141":193,"142":289,"143":249