":"/zh/getting-started-13","page_id":"/zh/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/getting-started#第一轮循环","content":"三个 `Tick` 的顺序**必须**是 紧张度 → 导演 → 世界。导演读取本帧的紧张度来铺设条件，\n世界接过条件后蔓延。"},"123":{"id":"/zh/getting-started-14","page_id":"/zh/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/getting-started#把受击反映到紧张度","content":"玩家被击中时，立即拉高紧张度。"},"124":{"id":"/zh/getting-started-15","page_id":"/zh/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/getting-started#替换数据","content":"规则表、动作、阈值都放在数据中心里且自带默认值，因此无需配置即可运行。\n要使用自己的数值，只需在启动时注册。"},"125":{"id":"/zh/getting-started-16","page_id":"/zh/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/getting-started#导入示例","content":"Package Manager → Tempo → **Samples** → *Basic Grass Fire*。导入后，\n`BasicGrassFireDirector` 组件可让你在屏幕上观察紧张度、阶段与蔓延。"},"126":{"id":"/zh/getting-started-17","page_id":"/zh/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/getting-started#下一步","content":"世界反应 深入了解蔓延规则。"},"127":{"id":"/zh/getting-started-18","page_id":"/zh/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/getting-started#下一步","content":"导演 自定义阶段与动作。"},"128":{"id":"/zh","page_id":"/zh","type":"page","content":"概述","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh"},"129":{"id":"/zh-0","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh","content":"导演只负责铺设条件，世界承接后自行把局势放大——一套自动调节紧张强弱的系统。"},"130":{"id":"/zh-1","page_id":"/zh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh#tempo-做什么","content":"Tempo 做什么"},"131":{"id":"/zh-2","page_id":"/zh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"一轮循环"},"132":{"id":"/zh-3","page_id":"/zh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh#核心原则","content":"核心原则"},"133":{"id":"/zh-4","page_id":"/zh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh#下一步","content":"下一步"},"134":{"id":"/zh-5","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#tempo-做什么","content":"这是一套让游戏自己制造危机局面的系统。&#x2A;*导演（演出）** 只是悄悄铺下火、雨、风之类的条件，\n**世界反应** 一侧便接过这些条件，像火势蔓延一样把局面放大。不必逐个场景手工编排，\n每一次都会自动发生不同的状况。"},"135":{"id":"/zh-6","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#tempo-做什么","content":"灵感来自两款游戏："},"136":{"id":"/zh-7","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#tempo-做什么","content":"**求生之路（Left 4 Dead）** —— 自动调节局势的强弱（节奏）。"},"137":{"id":"/zh-8","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#tempo-做什么","content":"**塞尔达传说：旷野之息** —— 火、水、电按固定规则彼此反应。"},"138":{"id":"/zh-9","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#tempo-做什么","content":"> **为何叫 Tempo：** 这个包最终做的事，就是调节游戏紧张感的「节奏（强弱）」。"},"139":{"id":"/zh-10","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"每一帧，三个部分始终按 **紧张度 → 导演 → 世界** 的顺序运行。"},"140":{"id":"/zh-11","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"部分"},"141":{"id":"/zh-12","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"类"},"142":{"id":"/zh-13","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"职责"},"143":{"id":"/zh-14","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"世界反应"},"144":{"id":"/zh-15","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"`WorldReaction`"},"145":{"id":"/zh-16","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"在网格上按规则蔓延，更新当前事件列表"},"146":{"id":"/zh-17","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"导演"},"147":{"id":"/zh-18","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"`DirectorBrain`"},"148":{"id":"/zh-19","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"看紧张度决定阶段，在预算内铺设条件"},"149":{"id":"/zh-20","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"紧张度模型"},"150":{"id":"/zh-21","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"`TensionModel`"},"151":{"id":"/zh-22","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#一轮循环","content":"把玩家威胁＋周围事件合成为一个 0\\~1 的数"},"152":{"id":"/zh-23","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#核心原则","content":"**把两个角色分开。** 世界反应完全不知道导演的存在，只按规则蔓延。"},"153":{"id":"/zh-24","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#核心原则","content":"**导演从不直接生成敌人。** 只铺设条件（在上游放火、雨、风、雷云）。"},"154":{"id":"/zh-25","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#核心原则","content":"**导演只看一个数** —— 紧张度（0\\~1）：玩家威胁与周围事件的合成值。"},"155":{"id":"/zh-26","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#核心原则","content":"**所有数值都在代码之外调。** 规则表、阈值、权重都抽成数据，策划无需写代码即可调整。"},"156":{"id":"/zh-27","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#下一步","content":"快速开始 —— 安装与第一轮循环。"},"157":{"id":"/zh-28","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#下一步","content":"世界反应 · 导演 · 紧张度 · 安全装置"},"158":{"id":"/zh-29","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#下一步","content":"API —— 对外可见的类一览。"},"159":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","type":"page","content":"放置类RPG","breadcrumbs":["Docs","应用场景"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg"},"160":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-0","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","content":"AFK Arena / 蘑菇勇者 —— 为自动进行与回归时刻做节奏编排。"},"161":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-1","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#部件对应","content":"部件对应"},"162":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-2","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#离线进度一次性结算","content":"离线进度，一次性结算"},"163":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-3","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#移动端要点","content":"移动端要点"},"164":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-4","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","content":"> **为何契合：** 放置类哪怕在玩家不看时也要有起伏，否则不会再打开。\n> 导演塑造一条紧张曲线，为「值得回来看的事件」做节奏。"},"165":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-5","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#部件对应","content":"Tempo"},"166":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-6","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#部件对应","content":"在放置类中"},"167":{"id":"/z