pg-18","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#移动端要点","content":"**起伏＝留存。** 平坦的自动进行会导致流失；导演用 Boss/猛攻制造回归动机。"},"179":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-19","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#移动端要点","content":"**预告＝推送。** 把「30 分钟后世界 Boss」预告接到推送通知，召回玩家。"},"180":{"id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg-20","page_id":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/idle-rpg#移动端要点","content":"**省电。** 回归时压缩重放而非每帧模拟 → 后台负载为零。"},"181":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","type":"page","content":"三消解谜","breadcrumbs":["Docs","应用场景"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/match-3"},"182":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-0","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/match-3","content":"Royal Match / Candy Crush / 梦幻花园 —— 反应规则表 = 特殊方块组合表。"},"183":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-1","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/match-3#部件对应","content":"部件对应"},"184":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-2","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/match-3#规则表示例","content":"规则表示例"},"185":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-3","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/match-3#用导演做橡皮筋难度","content":"用导演做橡皮筋难度"},"186":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-4","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/match-3#移动端要点","content":"移动端要点"},"187":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-5","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/match-3","content":"> **为何契合：** `ReactionRule` 表正是「特殊方块相遇会发生什么」的表。\n> 「水浇灭火」只是换成「火箭 + 炸弹 = 大爆炸」，结构完全一样。"},"188":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-6","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/match-3#部件对应","content":"Tempo"},"189":{"id":"/zh/examples/match-3-7","page_id":"/zh/examples/match-3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/match-3#部件对应","content":"在三消