","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"平静(BuildUp) → 猛攻/精英(Peak) → 喘息(Relax)"},"224":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-15","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"`SeedAction`"},"225":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-16","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"`SpawnSwarm` · `SpawnElite` · `OpenHazardZone` · `DropHealing`"},"226":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-17","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"`WorldReaction`"},"227":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-18","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"火海/毒云在网格上蔓延（沿用标准功能）"},"228":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-19","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"安全上限"},"229":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-20","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#部件对应","content":"同时敌人/场的上限 = **移动端发热／电量／帧率防护**"},"230":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-21","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#流程","content":"蓄势阶段削减敌人、放出回血/道具让玩家喘息；紧张度回落到低位时，猛攻就快来了。\n爆发阶段同时放出精英波次＋地面场来压缩画面。但 **必须先预告**（波次警告环、地面泛红），\n才不会变成「莫名其妙就死了」。"},"231":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-22","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#流程","content":"`SpawnSwarm`/`SpawnElite` 不直接生成敌人，而是铺设 **刷新条件**（打开刷新闸门）；\n实际的对象池/摆放由你游戏的刷新系统接手。导演只决定「何时、多少」。"},"232":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-23","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#移动端要点","content":"**上限就是性能预算。** `MaxActiveEvents` 与同屏敌人上限保护低端机帧率。"},"233":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-24","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#移动端要点","content":"**会话很短。** 把阶段周期控制在 1\\~2 分钟，让一局内蓄势→爆发→喘息循环多次。"},"234":{"id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like-25","page_id":"/zh/examples/survivor-like","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/survivor-like#移动端要点","content":"**预告要大。** 小屏上警告容易被淹没，用光环／屏幕边缘泛红明确提示。"},"235":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","type":"page","content":"塔防","breadcrumbs":["Docs","应用场景"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense"},"236":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-0","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","content":"Random Dice / 防御类 —— 自动调节波次强弱 + 状态异常连锁。"},"237":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-1","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"部件对应"},"238":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-2","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#状态连锁就是要素反应","content":"状态连锁就是要素反应"},"239":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-3","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#移动端要点","content":"移动端要点"},"240":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-4","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","content":"> **为何契合：** 两点同时命中 —— 导演的波次节奏（求生之路），以及冻结/感电在敌群中蔓延的\n> 状态异常连锁（旷野之息的电链，原样照搬）。"},"241":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-5","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"Tempo"},"242":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-6","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"在塔防中"},"243":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-7","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"`TensionModel`"},"244":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-8","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"防线压力（漏过的敌人数、核心血量）"},"245":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-9","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"`DirectorBrain` 阶段"},"246":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-10","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"侦察(BuildUp) → 猛攻/特殊怪(Peak) → 整顿(Relax)"},"247":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-11","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"`SeedAction`"},"248":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-12","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"`SeedColdSnap`（冻结场）· `ChargeStorm`（感电连锁）· `SpawnRusher`"},"249":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-13","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"`WorldReaction`"},"250":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-14","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"状态传播：冻结/感电从中招的敌人跳向邻近敌人（沿用要素反应）"},"251":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-15","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"安全上限"},"252":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-16","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#部件对应","content":"同时敌人/弹幕上限 = 移动端帧率防护"},"253":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-17","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#状态连锁就是要素反应","content":"旷野之息「电沿金属传导蔓延」的规则，直接映射到防御游戏「感电在潮湿/金属敌群中连锁」。\n只需把 `ReactionRule` 表当作敌人的状态异常来读。"},"254":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-18","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#状态连锁就是要素反应","content":"防线太轻松时（紧张度低）导演铺设猛攻/特殊怪来收紧；招架不住时（高）给出喘息。\n把感电引到玩家铺下的冻结场上的「要素连招」，也会从同一张表里自然产生。"},"255":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-19","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#移动端要点","content":"**连招即手感。** 把冻结 → 感电这类连锁放进规则表，就能以数据在线上新增连招。"},"256":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-20","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#移动端要点","content":"**波次节奏＝难度曲线。** 无需手工编排每一关，导演就能调节压力。"},"257":{"id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense-21","page_id":"/zh/examples/tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/examples/tower-defense#移动端要点","content":"**上限＝性能。** 用同时敌人/弹幕上限，在后期海量战斗中也保持帧率稳定。"},"258":{"id":"/zh/usage/director","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","type":"page","content":"导演","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用方法"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/director"},"259":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-0","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director","content":"看一个紧张度数值决定阶段，在预算内只铺设条件的一侧。"},"260":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-1","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"单个铺设动作 — `SeedAction`"},"261":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-2","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/director#导演的大脑--directorbrain","content":"导演的大脑 — `DirectorBrain`"},"262":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-3","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/director#阶段与预算","content":"阶段与预算"},"263":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-4","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/director#防抖动--phasefsm","content":"防抖动 — `PhaseFsm`"},"264":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-5","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director","content":"导演从不直接生成敌人。它看一个紧张度数值，决定阶段（蓄势→爆发→喘息），再在可用量（预算）内\n挑选动作，向世界 **只铺设条件**。"},"265":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-6","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"`Intent` 与阶段绑定 —— **Prepare**（蓄势）、**Trigger**（爆发）、**Calm**（喘息）。\n每个动作先用 `CanSeed` 确认「现在能铺吗」，并只调用世界的入口（`ApplyElement`/`SetWind`）。"},"266":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-7","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"四个内置动作："},"267":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-8","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"动作"},"268":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-9","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"Intent"},"269":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-10","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"职责"},"270":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-11","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"`DryUpwind`"},"271":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-12","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"Prepare"},"272":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-13","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"起风并烘干，营造易蔓延的条件（尚不点火）"},"273":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-14","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"`IgniteUpwind`"},"274":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-15","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"Trigger"},"275":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-16","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"向上风处的干草投下火种 → 顺风扑向玩家"},"276":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-17","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"`ChargeStorm`"},"277":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-18","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"Trigger"},"278":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-19","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"在金属／水洼上空降下雷云引发触电"},"279":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-20","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"`SummonRain`"},"280":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-21","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"Calm"},"281":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-22","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#单个铺设动作--seedaction","content":"降雨灭火并打湿，让玩家喘口气"},"282":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-23","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#导演的大脑--directorbrain","content":"要零改写直接使用，请用 `DefaultDirectorBrain`。"},"283":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-24","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#阶段与预算","content":"每个阶段给导演不同的预算，写在 `PhaseData` 里。"},"284":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-25","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#阶段与预算","content":"**蓄势(BuildUp)** —— 只一点点堆叠易燃条件（干草、电、燃料）。预算小，只放不危险的。"},"285":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-26","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#阶段与预算","content":"**爆发(Peak)** —— 在堆叠之上投下火种，瞬间燎原。多花预算。"},"286":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-27","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#阶段与预算","content":"**喘息(Relax)** —— 降雨灭火、喘口气并恢复预算。只用灭火类动作。"},"287":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-28","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#阶段与预算","content":"默认的 `PickActions` 会在预算内挑选 `Intent` 与阶段相符、且通过 `CanSeed` 的动作。\n需要更细的策略时再改写。"},"288":{"id":"/zh/usage/director-29","page_id":"/zh/usage/director","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/director#防抖动--phasefsm","content":"只有一个阈值时，阶段会在边界来回抖动。于是 **进入与退出用不同阈值**（迟滞），并保证最短喘息时间。"},"289":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","type":"page","content":"安全装置","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用方法"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/safeguards"},"290":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-0","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards","content":"防止连锁过度膨胀，并且导演铺设的条件务必通过预兆呈现。"},"291":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-1","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#1-上限","content":"1\\. 上限"},"292":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-2","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#2-喘息阶段优先灭火","content":"2\\. 喘息阶段优先灭火"},"293":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-3","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#3-在脚下引爆也手下留情","content":"3\\. 在脚下引爆也手下留情"},"294":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-4","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"4\\. 提前预告（预兆）"},"295":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-5","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#用调试工具查看","content":"用调试工具查看"},"296":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-6","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards","content":"世界可能制造出连导演也没料到的大连锁。为此设置几道防线。"},"297":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-7","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#1-上限","content":"对同时发生的事件数量／总量设上限。超过后，暂时停止点新火（Trigger 动作）。"},"298":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-8","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#1-上限","content":"`WorldReaction.BurningCells` 还能给出当前燃烧的格子数，可施加更严格的上限。"},"299":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-9","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#2-喘息阶段优先灭火","content":"在喘息（Relax）阶段只挑选 `Intent == Calm` 的动作（雨、灭火）。默认策略已经如此。"},"300":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-10","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#3-在脚下引爆也手下留情","content":"为避免导演铺设的条件正好在脚下引爆而秒杀玩家，在玩家附近降低威力或延后一拍，略作宽容。\n（在你的伤害处理中加入距离衰减的地方）"},"301":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-11","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"最重要的一条。导演铺设的条件 **务必预告** —— 乌云压境、风渐干燥。\n否则玩家只会想「我怎么突然就死了？」"},"302":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-12","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"`DryUpwind` → 风势变强、变干的演出（草叶摇曳、声音）。"},"303":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-13","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"`ChargeStorm` → 先有乌云聚拢的演出。"},"304":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-14","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"`IgniteUpwind` → 先让远处上风向出现小火星／烟。"},"305":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-15","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"读取 `DirectorBrain.CurrentPhase` 与 `WorldReaction.ActiveEvents` 来驱动你的预兆表现。"},"306":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-16","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#4-提前预告预兆","content":"> **为何重要：** 旷野之息用了「小小的障眼法」，但该让玩家看到的都清楚地呈现了。\n> 相反，网络创世纪（Ultima Online）的自治生态因玩家无从察觉而失败。\n> &#x2A;*该让人看到的，就要清楚地让人看到。**"},"307":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-17","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#用调试工具查看","content":"用编辑器的 **Tools → Tempo → Debug Window** 实时观察紧张度曲线、阶段、事件数与燃烧格子。\n在游戏代码中接入："},"308":{"id":"/zh/usage/safeguards-18","page_id":"/zh/usage/safeguards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/safeguards#用调试工具查看","content":"构建前用 **Tools → Tempo → Validate Rules**（或自动构建检查）找出规则表中不存在的材质与相互冲突的规则。"},"309":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","type":"page","content":"紧张度","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用方法"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/tension"},"310":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-0","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension","content":"把玩家威胁与周围活动合成为单个 0~1 数值的模型。"},"311":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-1","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/tension#三步","content":"三步"},"312":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-2","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/tension#对外可见部分","content":"对外可见部分"},"313":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-3","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/tension#受击即时威胁渐进","content":"受击即时，威胁渐进"},"314":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-4","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/tension#为测试注入信号","content":"为测试注入信号"},"315":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-5","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"调参 — `TensionConfig`"},"316":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-6","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension","content":"导演只看一个数：紧张度（0~~1）。`TensionModel` 用三步生成它：\n\\*\\*把两个信号归一到 0~~1 → 合成 → 平滑。\\*\\*"},"317":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-7","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#三步","content":"**归一** —— 把玩家威胁与周围活动各自映射到 0\\~1。"},"318":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-8","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#三步","content":"**合成** —— 任一项高，整体就上升；两项都高时接近最大（绝不超过 1）。公式为 `1-(1-a)(1-b)`。"},"319":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-9","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#三步","content":"**平滑** —— 上升快、下降慢。危险要立刻感到，安心则缓慢到来。"},"320":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-10","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#三步","content":"> **两种合成方式**\n>\n> * 默认：`1-(1-a)(1-b)`。\n> * 更鲜明：取两者较大值 `Mathf.Max(a, b)`。\n>\n> **关键是「上升快、下降慢」。** 这样蓄势→爆发→喘息的节奏才自然。"},"321":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-11","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#受击即时威胁渐进","content":"在 `Tick` 内，越近的威胁累积越多，并随时间逐渐回落。"},"322":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-12","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#为测试注入信号","content":"两个采样方法是 `virtual`，因此测试可在没有物理场景的情况下直接注入信号（用于替换接口）。"},"323":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-13","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#为测试注入信号","content":"默认的 `SampleThreat` 用 `Physics.OverlapSphere` 统计周围敌人；`SampleAround` 会对\n`world.ActiveEvents` 加权，使越近、越大的事件计入越多。"},"324":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-14","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"强度、半径、权重、速度、阈值全是数据。范围在你的游戏里调。"},"325":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-15","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"值"},"326":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-16","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"含义"},"327":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-17","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"`DamageGain`"},"328":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-18","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"受击时的即时升幅"},"329":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-19","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"`ThreatGain` / `StressDecay`"},"330":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-20","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"威胁累积 / 压力衰减"},"331":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-21","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"`StressWeight` / `AroundWeight`"},"332":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-22","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"合成两信号时的权重"},"333":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-23","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"`RiseSpeed` / `FallSpeed`"},"334":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-24","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"上升 / 下降的时间常数"},"335":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-25","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"`ThreatRadius` / `AroundRadius`"},"336":{"id":"/zh/usage/tension-26","page_id":"/zh/usage/tension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/tension#调参--tensionconfig","content":"采样半径"},"337":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"page","content":"世界反应","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用方法"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction"},"338":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-0","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","content":"火、水、电按规则相互转化、并在网格上蔓延的一侧。"},"339":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-1","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#单格状态--elementalstate","content":"单格状态 — `ElementalState`"},"340":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-2","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#材质--materialdef","content":"材质 — `MaterialDef`"},"341":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-3","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--reactionrule","content":"反应规则 — `ReactionRule`"},"342":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-4","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#蔓延与结果--worldreaction","content":"蔓延与结果 — `WorldReaction`"},"343":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-5","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#铺设网格","content":"铺设网格"},"344":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-6","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#直接铺设条件","content":"直接铺设条件"},"345":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-7","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","content":"世界反应完全不知道导演的存在。条件进来后，它按规则蔓延，并持续更新「当前事件」列表。"},"346":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-8","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#单格状态--elementalstate","content":"一个格子（或物体）的当前状态。由于网格要处理大量格子，用轻量 `struct`。"},"347":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-9","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#单格状态--elementalstate","content":"「是否易燃、是否导电、何时融化」这类 **不变的性质** 不写进状态，而是从 `MaterialDef` 中查。"},"348":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-10","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#材质--materialdef","content":"材质只注册一次，按索引共享。`RuleData.ResolveMaterialId(name)` 按名称查找，没有就新建并注册。"},"349":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-11","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--reactionrule","content":"反应放在表（数据）里而非代码：「这种要素／触到这种材质／超过阈值 → 这样变化」。"},"350":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-12","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--reactionrule","content":"目标材质写在 **以 `;` 分隔的单个字段**，而非数组 UI（项目约定）。读取时只拆分一次并缓存。\n留空则匹配所有材质。"},"351":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-13","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--reactionrule","content":"以旷野之息的三条基本规则为起点："},"352":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-14","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--reactionrule","content":"要素改变 **材质** —— 火点燃干草；"},"353":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-15","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--reactionrule","content":"要素改变 **另一种要素** —— 水浇灭火；"},"354":{"id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction-16","page_id":"/zh/usage/world-reaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/world-reaction#反应规则--rea